      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know how to find peace when i'm constantly terrified of the next bill or the next eviction notice. every \"moment of peace\" is just a temporary pause before the crushing weight comes back. honestly, the idea of just stopping... of not having to carry the weight anymore... it's the only thing that even makes me feel a little bit of relief when i think about it. like, what's the point of everything if the end result is just more of this?",
